            { text: "therefore {KAB} is to {LCD} also as {MF} is to {NH}.",
              visible: THIRD,
              highlighted: ["KAB","LCD","MF","NH"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "ratios the same with the same ratio", ref: "V.11" }] },
            { text: "Next, let {KAB} be to {LCD} as {MF} is to {NH}.",
              visible: FIG2,
              highlighted: ["KAB","LCD","MF","NH"] },
            { text: "I say also that {AB} is to {CD} as {EF} is to {GH}.",
              visible: FIG2,
              highlighted: ["AB","CD","EF","GH"] },
            { text: "For, if {EF} is not to {GH} as {AB} is to {CD},",
              visible: FIG2,
              highlighted: ["EF","GH","AB","CD"] },
            { text: "let {EF} be to {QR} as {AB} is to {CD}.",
              visible: QRL,
              highlighted: ["EF","QR","AB","CD"],
              transition: { mode: "cascade", animations: [
                  { elem: "Q", name: geomlib.A.Point.appear },
                  { elem: "R", name: geomlib.A.Point.appear },
                  { elem: "QRs", name: geomlib.A.Line.straightEdgeConnect } ] },
              justifications: [{ claim: "a fourth proportional QR", ref: "VI.12" }] },
            { text: "Describe the rectilinear figure {SR} similar and similarly situated to either of the two {MF} or {NH} on {QR}.",
              visible: SRF,
              highlighted: ["SR","MF","NH","QR"],
              transition: { mode: "cascade", animations: [
                  { elem: "QRS", name: geomlib.A.Polygon.outlineAndFill } ] },
              justifications: [{ ref: "VI.18" }] },
            { text: "Since then {AB} is to {CD} as {EF} is to {QR},",
