              highlighted: ["AB","CD","EF","QR"] },
            { text: "and there have been described on {AB} and {CD} the similar and similarly situated figures {KAB} and {LCD},",
              visible: SRF,
              highlighted: ["AB","CD","KAB","LCD"] },
            { text: "and on {EF} and {QR} the similar and similarly situated figures {MF} and {SR},",
              visible: SRF,
              highlighted: ["EF","QR","MF","SR"] },
            { text: "therefore {KAB} is to {LCD} as {MF} is to {SR}.",
              visible: SRF,
              highlighted: ["KAB","LCD","MF","SR"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "the first part of this proposition", ref: "Above" }] },
            { text: "But also, by hypothesis, {KAB} is to {LCD} as {MF} is to {NH},",
